# Shipping and Delivery Information

## Court Archive Shipping Policy

Court Archive currently offers standard shipping within the United States. Orders would normally be processed within 1--2 business days and delivered approximately 3--7 business days after shipment. Estimated delivery times are not guaranteed and may be affected by carrier delays, holidays, weather, or an incorrect shipping address.

A flat standard shipping rate of **\$5.99** is listed for orders under **\$75**, and standard shipping is free for orders of **\$75 or more**. Customers would receive an order confirmation and tracking information after an order ships. Court Archive does not currently offer local pickup or international shipping.

Because Court Archive is a classroom practice store, these terms are drafted for demonstration purposes and no real orders will be fulfilled.

![](images/clipboard-13583686.png)

# Return and Refund Policy

## Court Archive Return Policy

Court Archive accepts return requests within **30 days** of delivery. To qualify for a return, an item must be unworn, unused, unwashed, and in its original condition with any tags or packaging included. A customer should use the store's contact form and provide the order number, item name, and reason for the return before sending an item back.

Customers are responsible for return shipping unless an item arrived damaged, defective, or incorrect. Damaged or incorrect items should be reported within **7 days** of delivery and should include a photo of the issue. After an approved return is received and inspected, the refund would be issued to the original payment method. Original shipping charges are not refundable.

Final-sale items, gift cards, personalized products, worn socks, and opened drinkware are not eligible for return. Exchanges depend on product availability. Because this is a classroom practice store, this policy is a draft and no real refunds will be processed.\
